f36c6a7f0e814f97f5938868cdab66/ss_20dd1656e0f36c6a7f0e814f97f5938868cdab66.600x338.jpg?t=1758196935"},{"id":17,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029130/2dd9ca56bd091b3e2e49326f070f9118e24d948c/ss_2dd9ca56bd091b3e2e49326f070f9118e24d948c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758196935","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029130/2dd9ca56bd091b3e2e49326f070f9118e24d948c/ss_2dd9ca56bd091b3e2e49326f070f9118e24d948c.600x338.jpg?t=1758196935"}],"short_description":"The year is 2009, You are a modern warrior trained in the ancient Indian art of warfare. You are on a road trip to your village in your old trusty car, but an evil has trapped you. Explore this mystical monsters-infested Himalayan region with only one main goal: earn your freedom and reach home.","steam_appid":4029130,"support_info":{"email":"support@thechakragames.net","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://vichitrachakra.com/"}